<title>NORWAY: Statoil 9-month pre-tax profit NOK 12.3 bl.</title>
<headline>Statoil 9-month pre-tax profit NOK 12.3 bl.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>			     (billions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating profit	     13.1	 vs	 11.0</p>
<p>Profits before tax	   12.3	 vs	 12.4</p>
<p>Profits after tax	     3.9	 vs	  4.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of state-owned Norwegian oil, gas and petrochemicals group is Den norske stats oljeselskap AS.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
